# RDF Unreleased Release Notes

## Unreleased

-- New Features --

[New] rdf tokens --codex: Codex CLI spend from ~/.codex/sessions rollouts whose cwd is the project
      or below it, or --session with its spawned threads; per-response token_usage_record rows
      deduplicated by response_id (cumulative token_count deltas for older rollouts), model and
      Fast/Standard tier from turn_context and thread_settings_applied, subagent runs apart from
      sessions
[New] rdf tokens --codex: by_kind (review for a read-only sandbox, write for workspace-write or full
      access) and by_effort splits; account-wide plan quota (peak and latest used_percent per reset
      window and limit, plan, limit-reached events) from every rollout in the window, null with --session
[New] rdf tokens --pricing [--json]: the embedded price table with its as-of date, age, earliest
      promotional expiry and source pages (Anthropic and OpenAI pricing)

-- Changes --

[Change] rdf tokens prices: every current and retired Claude model from the Anthropic pricing page
         with explicit 5m/1h cache-write and cache-read rates, the Haiku 5.5 over-100K prompt tier,
         fast mode (usage.speed) and 1.1x US data residency (usage.inference_geo, Claude 4.6+);
         OpenAI Standard and Fast rates, with over-272K long-context rates, for Codex models
[Change] a model id matches a price key only as the exact id or the id plus a date, @version or
         -vN suffix; an unlisted newer model reports unpriced instead of borrowing a sibling's price

-- Bug Fixes --

[Fix] rdf tokens priced Claude Sonnet 5.5 as Sonnet 5 (cache reads $0.20 instead of $0.10 per
      MTok) and left Haiku 5.5, Opus 4.5-4.7, Sonnet 4.x and Mythos unpriced

